#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:5
#: ccc778ac4c29471eb3a247182ee93147
msgid "Using Python Scripts in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中使用 Python 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: 6287bdf630bc4f508c0cb9f2b5c87131
msgid ""
"One of the cool features of the Mission Planner is that it can run Python"
" scripts, which is an easy way to extend the functionality of the program"
" beyond its built-in functions. It can also enable integration easily "
"with other dlls and modules far beyond the original scope of the Mission "
"Planner."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的一项实用功能是可以运行 Python 脚本，这是一种在内置功能之外扩展程序功能的简便方式。它还可以轻松实现与其他"
" dll 及模块的集成，远超 Mission Planner 原有的功能范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:14
#: c83205943f9f4e5bbe8e15b7c527ec5e
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:16
#: 3cff7f16374f461f92575250a79766b4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can easily program your UAV to do anything, from robotic acrobatics "
"to just script-driven missions. Python 2.x is currently supported, up to "
"2.7 (Mission Planner uses an implementation of `IronPython "
"<https://ironpython.net/>`__ internally)"
msgstr ""
"您可以轻松编程让 UAV 执行任何操作，从机器人特技飞行到脚本驱动的任务均可实现。目前支持 Python 2.x，最高支持 2.7 "
"版本（Mission Planner 内部使用 `IronPython <http://ironpython.codeplex.com/>`__ "
"的实现）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner.rst:21
